#6704
The Narrow Crack~
A shower of pebbles fall behind you, making you instantly aware
that there may be unseen enemies lurking about. The crack now
widens and with relief you can now look north out across a vast vista
of bleak looking plains. Far off on the horizon is a faint gleam of
white. Below you is a slope leading down to the plains.
~
