#6705
The Blasted Heath~
The ground beneath your feet is stony with only a trace of soil.
Oddly, there appear to be no sign of life whatsoever, not a lichen,
an insect, a bird....nothing. You run your hand over one of the 
large boulders and notice it has an odd, smooth, glazed surface.
As you look ahead across the plain something equally odd catches your
eye. There appear to be strips and patches of ground hundreds of feet
long with the same odd appearance as the boulder. You now feel some
odd scratches under your hand on the boulder. 
~
