scratches boulder~
Before you is the Blasted Heath, site of the legendary battle,
many generations ago, between the great dragons of good and evil,
Grymthorne and Takhisis. Within minutes of their meeting this once
beautiful northern plain of villages and cattle pastures was reduced
to a half-melted, poisoned, barren waste. 
~
