#6712
A Scar On The Land~
A slippery smear of half-melted rock, the width of a house
and several hundred feet long, stretches before you. There are bubble-
like marks in the rock showing the intense heat that must have swept
down from the sky. You shudder to think what it might have been like 
on that terrible day when the heavens exploded with dragon-fire.
~
