#6713
The Mark of Dragon-Fire~
Before you is a vast shallow crater of shiny, greenish, glassy,
rock. It appears that a particularly violent part of the great
DragonWar took place here. Footing here is treacherous and you finally
slip and fall face down against the glassy surface. With a gasp of
horror you scramble to your feet! Buried in the melted rock are
scorched remains of people!........embedded here for all time.
~
