#6717
The Blasted Heath~
A piercing cry splits the air scaring you half to death. As
you look skyward for the source of the sound you are astonished
to see a single black raven soaring overhead. Although you are
happy to see SOME sign of life...a raven is not a harbinger of good
tidings. Still being so far from civilized places, running short
of supplies, and being freezing cold, you hardly see how things
could be worse.
~
